<title>USA: Boykin Lodging sets qtly div $0.45.</title>
<headline>Boykin Lodging sets qtly div $0.45.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boykin Lodging Co said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.45 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on May 15 to shareholders of record on March 31.</p>
<p>The company's prior distribution was its initial distribution for a return of capital.</p>
